sub1("The operator does not prompt with example words during verbal fluency, does not fill silences — pauses are the measurement — and does not correct, complete or comment on the participant's speech. Participants are identified only by code, with the linking key held separately by the clinician; recordings are stored encrypted on an unshared device, carry no names, national identifiers, addresses or telephone numbers, are deleted on withdrawal, are retained for the period the ethics committee specifies, and are neither uploaded to any third-party service nor shared outside the named research team without a further ethics amendment.",
     "The operator does not prompt with example words during verbal fluency, does not fill silences — pauses are the measurement — and does not correct, complete or comment on the participant's speech. Participants are identified only by code, with the linking key held separately by the clinician; recordings are stored encrypted on an unshared device, carry no names, national identifiers, addresses or telephone numbers, are deleted on withdrawal, are retained for the period the ethics committee specifies, and are neither uploaded to any third-party service nor shared outside the named research team without a further ethics amendment.")
