sub1("The total number of words the participant speaks across the two connected-discourse tasks, under the fixed elicitation above, is one number counted from the transcript with no software; on Delaware it reaches AUC 0.6420 [0.5786, 0.7052] for mild impairment against control, while estimated alike the fair single-feature comparator is 0.6018, so the modelling apparatus buys about +0.036 and the hand count does not match it (section 5.16). This pilot is not powered to test it, so what is registered is descriptive: the distribution of total discourse words in healthy Libyan participants, the first such normative observation in Arabic; the impaired group's distribution beside it, with no significance test and no AUC; and the fraction of sessions in which the fixed elicitation was actually achieved. Markedly fewer words than the English reference distribution would be expected, since Arabic conveys in fewer orthographic words what English spreads across more, and would be a reason to derive the threshold from local controls, not a reason to doubt the measure.",
     "The total number of words the participant speaks across the two connected-discourse tasks, under the fixed elicitation above, is one number counted from the transcript with no software; on Delaware it reaches AUC 0.6420 [0.5786, 0.7052] for mild impairment against control, while estimated alike the fair single-feature comparator is 0.6018, so the modelling apparatus buys about +0.036 and the hand count does not match it (section 5.16). This pilot is not powered to test it, so what is registered is descriptive: the distribution of total discourse words in healthy Libyan participants, the first such normative observation in Arabic; the impaired group's distribution beside it, with no significance test and no AUC; and the fraction of sessions in which the fixed elicitation was achieved. Markedly fewer words than the English reference distribution would be expected, since Arabic conveys in fewer orthographic words what English spreads across more, and would be a reason to derive the threshold from local controls, not to doubt the measure.")
